---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Chinese-Zodiac-Calculator.com"
  description="Read the Chinese-Zodiac-Calculator.com privacy policy to understand how we collect and protect your data when using our Chinese zodiac calculator and related website tools."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "Privacy", href: "/privacy-policy" }]}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[800px] px-4 py-12 lg:px-6 lg:py-16">
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 sm:text-4xl">Privacy <span class="text-[#DC2626]">Policy</span></h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Last updated: July 24, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-stone max-w-none dark:prose-invert space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>Chinese-Zodiac-Calculator.com does not require an account or registration. When you use our zodiac calculator or browse our pages, we may collect:</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Birth date</strong> — nly the date you enter into the calculator; this is processed client-side and is not stored on our servers.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Usage data</strong> — nonymous analytics such as page views, referring site, browser type, and device type via our analytics provider.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Cookies</strong> — e use minimal cookies for analytics and site functionality. No cookies are used for advertising or tracking across other sites.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the limited data we collect solely to: improve our website and content, analyze usage patterns to enhance user experience, and respond to inquiries submitted through our contact form. We do not sell, rent, or share personal information with third parties for their marketing purposes.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">3. Data Storage &amp; Security</h2>
        <p>All zodiac calculations are performed in your browser. No birth date information is transmitted to or stored on our servers. Our site uses HTTPS encryption for all data in transit. We implement industry-standard security measures to protect any information we do collect.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We may use the following third-party services, each with their own privacy policies: Cloudflare (CDN and security), Vercel or similar hosting provider, and an analytics service (e.g., Plausible or Fathom) that does not track personal data across sessions. We choose privacy-focused analytics that do not use cookies where possible.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to: request access to personal data we hold about you, request deletion of your data, opt out of analytics tracking (via Do Not Track or browser privacy settings), and withdraw any consent you have given. To exercise these rights, contact us via the contact form.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">6. Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use only essential cookies required for site functionality and, if applicable, a privacy-respecting analytics cookie. You can control cookies through your browser settings. Blocking cookies may affect site functionality.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">8. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy or how your data is handled, please reach out through our <a href="/contact" class="text-[#DC2626] hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
